    {
      "fileName": "pistoleros-challenge.json",
      "id": "yOyMlFGAgLfRas8m",
      "name": "Pistolero's Challenge",
      "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
      "type": "feat",
      "data": {
        "_id": "yOyMlFGAgLfRas8m",
        "folder": "L530Sm40Wd1WZ334",
        "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
        "name": "Pistolero's Challenge",
        "system": {
          "actionType": {
            "value": "action"
          },
          "actions": {
            "value": 1
          },
          "category": "class",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>With a stern call, carefully chosen barb, or some other challenging declaration, you demand your foe's attention in a duel. Choose an opponent within 30 feet who you can perceive and can hear you, and make your choice of a @Check[deception|defense:will] or @Check[intimidation|defense:will] check against the target's Will DC. No matter the result of the check, the foe is temporarily immune to your Pistolero's Challenge until noon the next day.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> Both you and the opponent gain a +2 status bonus to damage rolls with Strikes made against each other. If you're a master in the skill you used for the check, the status bonus to damage rolls increases to +3, and if you're legendary, it increases to +4.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feat-effects.Item.Effect: Pistolero's Challenge]</p>\n<p>You can have only one challenge in effect at a time; challenging a new opponent ends this effect on any current target. Otherwise, the effect lasts until one of you is defeated, flees, or the encounter ends.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> You become @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Frightened]{Frightened 1} and can't use this ability again for 1 minute.</p>"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 6
          },
          "prerequisites": {
            "value": [
              {
                "value": "Way of the Pistolero"
              }
            ]
          },
          "publication": {
            "license": "ORC",
            "remaster": true,
            "title": "Pathfinder Guns & Gears"
          },
          "rules": [],
          "traits": {
            "rarity": "common",
            "value": [
              "auditory",
              "flourish",
              "gunslinger",
              "linguistic",
              "mental"
            ]
          }
        },
        "type": "feat"
      },
      "level": 6,
      "category": "class"
    },
    {
      "fileName": "scatter-blast.json",
      "id": "L9sRaFl0tHT5AFIQ",
      "name": "Scatter Blast",
      "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
      "type": "feat",
      "data": {
        "_id": "L9sRaFl0tHT5AFIQ",
        "folder": "L530Sm40Wd1WZ334",
        "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
        "name": "Scatter Blast",
        "system": {
          "actionType": {
            "value": "action"
          },
          "actions": {
            "value": 2
          },
          "category": "class",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> You're wielding a loaded firearm that has the scatter trait.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>You pack your weapon with additional shot and powder, creating a risky but devastating wave of destruction. Make a ranged Strike with the firearm. The firearm's range increment increases by 20 feet and the radius of its scatter increases by 20 feet. The Strike gains the following failure conditions.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The firearm misfires, but it doesn't cause the other critical failure effects listed below.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The firearm misfires and also explodes. It becomes broken, and it deals its normal weapon damage to all creatures in a @Template[burst|distance:20] centered on the firearm, with a basic Reflex save against your class DC. This damage includes any from the weapon's fundamental and property runes.</p>"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 6
          },
          "prerequisites": {
